{"id":633,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"多様性と国際性を尊重する協働教育","feature_description":"多様性と国際性を尊重する協働教育を教育の中心に据え、教科の学びと学校生活を結び付けながら、生徒が自ら考え行動する力を育てます。基礎となる知識や技能を着実に身に付けるとともに、探究、対話、行事、部活動などの経験を通して、多様な仲間と協働し課題に向き合います。一人ひとりが目標を見つけ、学びを深め、社会や世界に関わる視野を広げられるよう支える教育です。","clubs":[{"id":11829,"name":"Scholars","category":"その他","source_url":"https://sis.kwansei.ac.jp/studentlife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11830,"name":"数学","category":"その他","source_url":"https://sis.kwansei.ac.jp/studentlife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11831,"name":"eスポーツ","category":"その他","source_url":"https://sis.kwansei.ac.jp/studentlife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11832,"name":"EJAAD","category":"その他","source_url":"https://sis.kwansei.ac.jp/studentlife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11833,"name":"子どもたちのためのSDGs","category":"その他","source_url":"https://sis.kwansei.ac.jp/studentlife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11834,"name":"セイバーズ・チアリーディング","category":"その他","source_url":"https://sis.kwansei.ac.jp/studentlife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11835,"name":"タンゴ","category":"その他","source_url":"https://sis.kwansei.ac.jp/studentlife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11836,"name":"チーム・サイエンス","category":"その他","source_url":"https://sis.kwansei.ac.jp/studentlife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11837,"name":"日本語演劇","category":"その他","source_url":"https://sis.kwansei.ac.jp/studentlife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11838,"name":"茶道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://sis.kwansei.ac.jp/studentlife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11839,"name":"競技かるた部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://sis.kwansei.ac.jp/studentlife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11840,"name":"料理部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://sis.kwansei.ac.jp/studentlife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11841,"name":"お菓子部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://sis.kwansei.ac.jp/studentlife/club","verifi